      },
      "message": "fix(sim): judge and draw a necked tool at its drawn neck\n\nThe stack laws (reach c/c3, fixture c2/d2, posed and mesh sweeps, the\nsolid law's atoms) and the simulated tool read a tool's drawn cutter\noutline over the shank span where it is narrower than the stated shank,\nnever wider - one source for the judged envelope, riding the existing\nHolderStack seam as a `neck` field (`HolderStack::shank_bands`) and the\nsim Cutter as `NeckBands`. No drawn cutter, one that no longer agrees\nwith the numbers, or one with no neck judges and draws bit-identically.\nA drawn neck now enters the op stamp. Drill reach, the probe stylus and\nmulti-axis avoidance stay on the cylinder (#842).\n\nFixes #852\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
